  "scope": "Fourteen predeclared pairs, both directions. Ten true positives, portrait negative, self and true/wrong table controls. Prior selected support bounding regions for first12; fixed central160pixel squares for table controls. Supplied historical geometry; no refit or score-based site selection. Square320 float bilinear Pillow stored JPEG RGB patches, require EXIF1; not native linear decoding nor author global preprocessing. Pixel centers x+(u+.5)*width/320-.5; homography maps coordinates to target, competitors shift target samples32pixels. Common valid support across source/baseline/all four competitors, invalid sites shared neutral gray; mask-only embeddings expose shared-mask confound but cannot remove it. Per-image semantic context and training-selected geometry/ROIs not independent heldout. No threshold, production integration, copy identity, precision or universal recall claim."
}
